---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import trailImage from '../assets/images/eucalyptus-trail.png';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Bush Gums"
  description="How Bush Gums curates affordable beginner overnight hiking gear."
>
  <article class="content-page">
    <div class="container narrow prose">
      <h1>Your first setup should feel possible.</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        Bush Gums helps ordinary Australians make a first overnight gear
        decision without spending thousands or wading through jargon.
      </p>
      <Image
        class="prose-image"
        src={trailImage}
        alt="A hiker following a eucalyptus bush track in New South Wales"
        widths={[560, 760, 1000]}
        sizes="(max-width: 850px) 100vw, 760px"
        format="webp"
      />
      <h2>Curated, not manufactured</h2>
      <p>
        We curate researched products and explain where to find them. Bush Gums
        does not manufacture, stock or fulfil the products shown on this site.
        External merchants set their own price, stock, shipping, returns and
        warranty terms.
      </p>
      <h2 id="how-we-choose">How we choose gear</h2>
      <ol>
        <li>
          <strong>Start with the overnight.</strong> We ask what a beginner needs
          the gear to do, and how it will feel to carry, set up and live with.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Listen to owners.</strong> We read owner experience alongside published
          specifications, looking for repeated patterns in comfort, ease of use, durability
          and friction.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Keep the limits visible.</strong> We do not claim that budget gear
          is equivalent to high-end counterparts. We are honest about limitations
          in durability and long-term use. However, we remain convinced that our recommendations
          are sound for most casual and moderate use.
        </li>
      </ol>
      <h2>What we are building</h2>
      <p>
        The goal is simple: make first overnight gear choices more
        understandable and affordable.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
